Fast Load is a ranger technique that dramatically increases the rate of
fire with ranged weapons. Through practiced movements and efficient arrow
management, rangers with this skill can loose multiple arrows in the time
it takes others to fire once.

This passive skill automatically reloads your ranged weapon after firing,
allowing for additional shots per combat round. The number of arrows you
can fire increases based on both your Fast Load skill and your Ranged
Specialization proficiency.

Rangers who master Fast Load become devastating at range, capable of
filling the air with arrows before enemies can close the distance. This
skill is essential for any ranger who favors the bow over melee combat.

Class: Warrior, Ranger
Discipline: Ranged

